	RET

; Storage map for FCPOLY.POLISHED, a COMPLEX*16 function
;   POLISHED  COMPLEX*16                  hidden argument 1  @FCPOLY.POLISHED.POLISHED(AP)
;   M         COMPLEX*16, INTENT(IN) (:)  argument 2         @FCPOLY.POLISHED.M(AP)
;   Z         COMPLEX*16, INTENT(IN)      argument 3         @FCPOLY.POLISHED.Z(AP)
;   P         COMPLEX*16                  $LOCAL+0           FCPOLY.POLISHED.P
